EastSun 1006 (a screenshot of the strip): "圖片上的功能我不需要"
- media/props.js: the diffnote strip is not drawn (if (diffs && false)). The rows
  that differ from the .dfm still show their DFM value and the small reset square;
  the menu's 改回 DFM and the multi-select "全部改回 DFM（n 個）" in the align
  section stay.
- test/panels_render.ps1: the two strip checks now check that it is gone.

Tests: run_all 3/3 layers; real VS Code 159/159.

